### 1. Build LLVM Pass
```
$ mkdir build && cd build
$ cmake ..
$ make -j
$ cd ..
```

Or, on Mac with LLVM installed via Homebrow, you can just run:

```
sh mac_build.sh
```

without needing to manually specify your LLVM source.

### 2. Run Prefetch Experiments (Greedy / Selective)
```
$ chmod +x test.sh

Single benchmark (auto-detect Olden/Ptrdist):
$ ./test.sh em3d
$ ./test.sh bh
$ ./test.sh anagram

All Olden:
$ ./test.sh olden

All Ptrdist:
$ ./test.sh ptrdist

All benchmarks:
$ ./test.sh all

test.sh runs "make time" and "make perf", producing intermediate
results in each benchmark's Output/ directory (.bc, .time, .out, perf_*.txt).
```

### 3. Clean Intermediate Files
```
$ chmod +x clean.sh

Clean all benchmark intermediates:
$ ./clean.sh

Clean intermediates + remove build/:
$ ./clean.sh --all

Only remove build/:
$ ./clean.sh --build
```
